      "description": "Industrial & Commercial Project Support for project managers, contractors, and operations buyers: warehouse and distribution, commercial relocation and logistics including white-glove and blanket-wrap handling, FF&E installation and project support, and flexible project-support deployment for planned, overflow, peak, weekend, vacation, and emergency needs — priced per job with no required contract duration. Standard Job Pricing: Unload $8.00/CWT, Load $10.00/CWT, APU $12.00/CWT, Residential/Driver Meet $400-$425 per man, quoted per job, adjustable for scope, equipment, travel, and after-hours requirements agreed before dispatch. Supervised, self-managed project teams support military and regular household-goods, warehouse, and residential jobs needing extra manpower. Served from Winchester, VA and Martinsburg, WV across the Shenandoah Valley and Eastern Panhandle. Guaranteed Flat Rate or Your Move is Free!"
